# Normalise line endings so Windows and Linux checkouts match
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.xlsx binary
*.parquet binary
*.png binary

# The reviewer export: stored verbatim, never line-ending translated. MANIFEST.md publishes
# a sha256 per file, and a checkout that rewrote the newlines would make every one of them
# wrong on the reviewer's machine - the checksum has to mean the same thing everywhere.
export/feedback_clean.csv -text
export/feedback_clean.json -text
